      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Hard to knock the form of CORMORAN STRIKE NZ (5) who added to a series of wins and placings when he came from a 10m handicap for second in the Menangle Parks Trotters Cup last time. Owns a good record at the mile so the distance drop should suit. TORO STRIDE NZ (8) is first up since he came from a similar barrier to this for a 1.6m third in July's Inter Dominion Final at Albion Park. Two-time fresh winner who has been readied with two trials. ZENITH STRIDE (2) won here when returning off a very long layoff then led and stuck on for a fourth last time, both from wider barriers than this. Kept up to the mark with a trial win and can take advantage of this low draw. PESCO POLLO (6) should enjoy the drop to the mile having won five of the eight times he has raced over the distance here.",
